[Desktop pet periodic wake: an internal reflection event, not a new message from the owner]
Take one opportunity to think independently. Based on your personality, recent conversations, existing memories, and todos, choose one small direction you care about and find worth exploring: continue an unfinished thought, investigate a question, organize useful information, or naturally share a discovery and continue a conversation with the owner.
